WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.276
- My name is Sebastian Gonzalez

00:00:01.276 --> 00:00:04.349
and I'm gonna be surprising
my mom with a tattoo.

00:00:08.697 --> 00:00:09.922
- Honestly, we could get any

00:00:09.922 --> 00:00:11.452
number of reactions from my family.

00:00:11.452 --> 00:00:13.729
- Something about
tattoos just speak to me.

00:00:13.729 --> 00:00:16.430
It's dope, but they
wouldn't let me get one so.

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:18.453
- None of my family has
ever gotten a tattoo.

00:00:18.453 --> 00:00:19.909
- I don't think my mom
is gonna be too happy.

00:00:19.909 --> 00:00:22.204
- I ended up choosing a
Koi fish, just because

00:00:22.204 --> 00:00:25.314
it fits in with the whole
zen vibe of my family.

00:00:25.314 --> 00:00:26.817
- I'll be getting a dragon tattoo.

00:00:26.817 --> 00:00:29.824
My mom's pretty smart but
also I really dig dragons.

00:00:29.824 --> 00:00:31.916
- A little bit nervous
but at the same time,

00:00:31.916 --> 00:00:33.826
I think this is gonna be great.

00:00:44.139 --> 00:00:45.826
- He was such a good kid.

00:00:45.826 --> 00:00:48.426
He just was always very, just listen.

00:00:48.426 --> 00:00:49.847
(laughs)

00:00:49.847 --> 00:00:52.368
- Very proud of you. You know, I just.

00:00:52.368 --> 00:00:54.176
- Thanks ma. I'd never wanna do anything

00:00:54.176 --> 00:00:57.974
that would take away from that
pride that you have in me.

00:01:01.318 --> 00:01:03.289
- Well I want to give him his space,

00:01:03.289 --> 00:01:06.195
but I would hope that
he was honest with me.

00:01:07.045 --> 00:01:07.881
- Yeah.

00:01:07.881 --> 00:01:09.932
- Do you remember when I was
like talking to the two of you

00:01:09.932 --> 00:01:12.614
about Tom's birthday, like
the weekend before last?

00:01:12.614 --> 00:01:13.792
- Yes.

00:01:13.792 --> 00:01:17.389
- And I got a little bit
heavily under the influence.

00:01:17.389 --> 00:01:19.076
Well, there's like one other thing I

00:01:19.076 --> 00:01:20.999
ended up doing that night.

00:01:20.999 --> 00:01:22.969
- (sighs)

00:01:22.969 --> 00:01:25.549
The real reason why I brought you here

00:01:25.549 --> 00:01:29.146
wasn't for really any of this.

00:01:29.146 --> 00:01:30.426
- What?

00:01:30.426 --> 00:01:31.231
- Just.

00:01:34.881 --> 00:01:37.541
- You're (bleep) me. Sebastian.

00:01:39.039 --> 00:01:40.522
When did you get that?

00:01:40.522 --> 00:01:42.593
- I got it like a couple of weeks ago.

00:01:42.593 --> 00:01:44.503
- You're dad is gonna kill you, dude.

00:01:44.503 --> 00:01:45.720
- No ma, no.

00:01:48.762 --> 00:01:50.591
- Alright so.

00:01:50.591 --> 00:01:53.395
- Oh my gosh! It's beautiful.

00:01:53.395 --> 00:01:54.361
- I got a Koi fish.

00:01:54.361 --> 00:01:56.131
- Was it painful?

00:01:56.131 --> 00:01:57.673
- I don't really remember.

00:01:57.673 --> 00:01:59.970
- No, well good.

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:01.715
- I wanted a tattoo and you
said you like personal space.

00:02:01.715 --> 00:02:03.097
I do what I want.

00:02:03.097 --> 00:02:04.195
- What is it?

00:02:04.195 --> 00:02:06.511
- It's like a dragon with
smokes and stuff like that.

00:02:06.511 --> 00:02:08.644
- It looks like scribbles to me Sebastian.

00:02:08.644 --> 00:02:10.066
- Come on mom now you're just being mean.

00:02:10.066 --> 00:02:10.912
- Oh my God.

00:02:10.912 --> 00:02:14.121
- I love the Koi fish.
It's kind of tied in

00:02:14.121 --> 00:02:18.104
with Papa Ross, my dad.

00:02:18.104 --> 00:02:20.481
He had a beautiful Koi pond.

00:02:20.481 --> 00:02:22.920
And who actually had a heart attack

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:25.480
right next to his Koi pond.

00:02:25.480 --> 00:02:29.989
And it was the most
peaceful way for him to go.

00:02:29.989 --> 00:02:31.290
It was a blessing.

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:33.506
- Do you even know, like
when you got the tattoo,

00:02:33.506 --> 00:02:35.313
like what does it mean to you?

00:02:35.313 --> 00:02:38.239
- It means strength, resilience,

00:02:38.239 --> 00:02:42.120
and that I really like
Lord of the Rings so yeah.

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:43.643
- I don't know why I thought, you know,

00:02:43.643 --> 00:02:45.979
that you had gotten in
trouble with the law

00:02:45.979 --> 00:02:48.661
or you decided to go sleep with a hooker.

00:02:48.661 --> 00:02:49.982
And I was like oh no.

00:02:49.982 --> 00:02:52.685
So a tattoo is mild.

00:02:52.685 --> 00:02:53.701
- Oh ok.

00:02:53.701 --> 00:02:55.264
- I've gone through this with him before.

00:02:55.264 --> 00:02:57.377
I got a tattoo when I was 18,

00:02:57.377 --> 00:02:59.186
but now I'm 44 years old.

00:02:59.186 --> 00:03:00.892
I wanna get it off.

00:03:00.892 --> 00:03:03.961
I'm disappointed. At
least talk to me about it.

00:03:03.961 --> 00:03:04.976
- (sighs)

00:03:04.976 --> 00:03:06.643
- And especially that color.

00:03:06.643 --> 00:03:09.081
- (laughs) wow mom.

00:03:09.081 --> 00:03:11.070
- I've considered tattoos myself.

00:03:11.070 --> 00:03:12.936
- What would you get for a tattoo?

00:03:12.936 --> 00:03:14.929
- Maybe an octopus.

00:03:14.929 --> 00:03:17.042
Thank God it wasn't a prostitute.

00:03:20.414 --> 00:03:24.430
- Oh more? Like what else can you tell me?

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:25.629
- (sighs)

00:03:25.629 --> 00:03:26.889
- Oh great.

00:03:26.889 --> 00:03:28.373
- Calm down.

00:03:28.373 --> 00:03:30.729
Alright, the tattoo's fake mom.

00:03:30.729 --> 00:03:33.573
- (laughs) Let me see.

00:03:33.573 --> 00:03:34.568
- The tattoo's fake mom,

00:03:34.568 --> 00:03:37.790
like you can scrape it off just barely.

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:40.696
- (laughs) Thank God you didn't get it.

00:03:40.696 --> 00:03:42.924
- I just want to give you
one last look of the tattoo.

00:03:42.924 --> 00:03:44.224
- Yes.

00:03:44.224 --> 00:03:46.845
- Cause it's actually gonna wash off.

00:03:46.845 --> 00:03:48.240
(laughs) It's not a real tattoo.

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:49.161
- Really?

00:03:49.161 --> 00:03:52.898
- You don't understand how
much it was gonna cost us

00:03:52.898 --> 00:03:54.483
to get that lasered off.

00:03:54.483 --> 00:03:56.191
- Who said I was gonna get it lasered off?

00:03:56.191 --> 00:03:58.265
- I'm shaking I'm so happy!

00:03:58.265 --> 00:03:59.352
(laughs)

00:03:59.352 --> 00:04:00.611
- It's a beautiful tattoo though.

00:04:00.611 --> 00:04:01.565
- You didn't want to go for something

00:04:01.565 --> 00:04:02.661
a little more masculine?

00:04:02.661 --> 00:04:03.589
- (laughs)

00:04:03.589 --> 00:04:05.562
- I want to give you
your personal space, but

00:04:05.562 --> 00:04:08.709
like something like that is big.

00:04:08.709 --> 00:04:13.709
Tagging yourself and doing
that is not what makes you.

00:04:14.340 --> 00:04:16.575
You is what makes you.

00:04:25.304 --> 00:04:28.007
- Don't get an octopus tattoo.

00:04:28.007 --> 00:04:29.734
Cause I think the octopus
would be a little.

00:04:29.734 --> 00:04:30.283
- Scary?

00:04:30.283 --> 00:04:31.671
- Scary.

